  "historyNote": "#6393, eff 12-4-96, EXPIRED: 12-04-04 New. #8416, INTERIM, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRES: 2-19-06; ss by #8541, eff 2-20-06; renumbered by #9206 (formerly He-W 404.03); ss by #10645, eff 7-22-14; amd by #12611, eff 8-23-18; amd by #14127, INTERIM, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 5-25-25 (Remains in effect per RSA 541-A:14-a); ss by #14276, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
